1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,064
这是一台虚拟机上的一个小应用
Here is a small app on one virtual machine:

2
00:00:03,064 --> 00:00:07,125
前面一台 Web 服务器，后面是一个前端和两个 API
a web server in front, a frontend and two APIs behind it.

3
00:00:07,445 --> 00:00:10,453
如果其中一个半夜崩了，谁来重启它？
If one of them crashes in the night, who restarts it?

4
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:13,943
凌晨两点，一个 API container 崩了
At two in the morning, one API container crashes.

5
00:00:14,263 --> 00:00:17,327
应用负责人要等用户投诉才知道
The app owner finds out when users complain,

6
00:00:17,327 --> 00:00:21,367
运维通过 SSH 登录进去，手动重启它
and the operator logs in over SSH and restarts it by hand.

7
00:00:21,617 --> 00:00:25,201
在第 20 讲里，Docker 能重启崩掉的 container
In lecture 20, Docker could restart a crashed container,

8
00:00:25,201 --> 00:00:30,961
但只限那一台机器：如果机器本身挂了，整个网站就只能等你来救
but only on that one machine: if the machine itself failed, the whole site waited for you.

9
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:33,717
于是应用负责人要多台服务器
So the app owner asks for several servers.

10
00:00:34,037 --> 00:00:39,051
运维给了三台机器，每个 API 旁边再放一个备份
The operator answers with three machines, and a backup copy beside each API.

11
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:42,351
每个备份都和它的原件在同一台机器上
Each backup sits on the same machine as its original.

12
00:00:42,671 --> 00:00:48,025
说出一个仍然会让这个 API 挂掉的故障，再说说是谁切换到备份
Name one failure that still takes that API down, and say who switches to the backup.

13
00:00:56,867 --> 00:01:01,646
是机器本身：一块坏掉的磁盘或一次网络故障，会同时带走两份
The machine itself: one failed disk or network takes both copies at once.

14
00:01:01,966 --> 00:01:06,509
而且就算备份活下来了，还是得有人手动切换
And even when a backup survives, a person still has to switch over by hand.

15
00:01:06,750 --> 00:01:09,822
课上要的是，没人醒着也能把三件事做好
The lecture wants three jobs done with nobody awake.

16
00:01:10,142 --> 00:01:12,745
故障转移：一个正常的副本接手
Failover: a working copy takes over.

17
00:01:13,065 --> 00:01:16,094
负载均衡：请求分散到各个副本上
Load balancing: requests spread across copies.

18
00:01:16,414 --> 00:01:18,953
扩展：流量变大时就多开副本
Scaling: more copies when traffic grows.

19
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:21,522
每当我们看到是谁在做其中一件事
This card comes back each time we see

20
00:01:21,522 --> 00:01:24,597
这张卡片就会回来，那时我们就勾上它
what does one of these jobs, and we tick it then.

21
00:01:24,917 --> 00:01:27,221
三件事用的工具都是 Kubernetes
The tool for all three is Kubernetes.

22
00:01:29,267 --> 00:01:31,238
Kubernetes 是一个编排工具
Kubernetes is an orchestrator:

23
00:01:31,238 --> 00:01:34,325
它在一个由多台机器组成的集群上运行 container
it runs containers across a cluster of machines

24
00:01:34,325 --> 00:01:36,691
并让它们保持你声明的样子
and keeps them the way you declared.

25
00:01:37,011 --> 00:01:39,108
这个名字在希腊语里是舵手的意思
The name is Greek for helmsman,

26
00:01:39,108 --> 00:01:41,747
而第 2 部分用到的工具 Helm，也借了这个词
and Helm, a tool in part 2, borrows it.

27
00:01:41,984 --> 00:01:46,144
左边，一台机器在一个 Docker 引擎上跑所有 container
On the left, one machine runs every container on one Docker engine.

28
00:01:46,464 --> 00:01:48,273
右边，很多台机器，叫作节点
On the right, many machines,

29
00:01:48,273 --> 00:01:53,120
分担这些 container，由一个控制平面来协调
called nodes, share the containers, and one control plane coordinates them.

30
00:01:53,367 --> 00:01:57,451
提醒一句：这里的“部署”指一种部署方式
A word of warning: here, deployment means a way of deploying,

31
00:01:57,451 --> 00:02:00,130
不是我们后面要见到的 Deployment 对象
not the Deployment object we meet later.

32
00:02:00,367 --> 00:02:03,610
在第 20 讲里，奶酪应用跑在一台机器上
In lecture 20 the cheese app ran on one machine.

33
00:02:03,930 --> 00:02:08,111
现在同一个应用搬到集群上，工具里多了 kubectl
Now the same app goes to a cluster, and the tools gain kubectl.

34
00:02:08,431 --> 00:02:10,273
我们的工具箱里已经有它了
Our toolbox already has it,

35
00:02:10,273 --> 00:02:14,639
还有 Helm 和 GKE 认证插件，这两个课件上没列
plus Helm and the GKE auth plugin, which the slides do not list.

36
00:02:14,884 --> 00:02:19,466
跟着做需要：cheese-app-v3，旁边放着你的 secrets 目录
To follow along: cheese-app-v3 with your secrets folder beside it,

37
00:02:19,466 --> 00:02:22,799
再加上 Docker，以及一个开通了结算的 Google Cloud 项目
Docker, and a Google Cloud project with billing.

38
00:02:23,119 --> 00:02:27,449
集群按小时收费，所以每个部分最后都会把它删掉
A cluster costs money by the hour, so each part ends by deleting it.

39
00:02:27,684 --> 00:02:32,299
进度条标出 README 的哪一步，代码面板标出文件和行号
The tracker names the README step, code panels name their file and lines,

40
00:02:32,299 --> 00:02:34,639
your turn 表示暂停一下，自己跑一遍
and your turn means pause and run it.

41
00:02:34,959 --> 00:02:37,796
角落里的灰色标签标出课件的页码
A grey tag in the corner names the lecture slides.

42
00:02:38,034 --> 00:02:41,853
如实说一句：我们录制用的机器没有 Google 账号
One honest note: our recording machine has no Google account.

43
00:02:42,173 --> 00:02:44,739
在你自己的机器上能跑的都是真的
What runs on a machine you own is real;

44
00:02:44,739 --> 00:02:48,029
每个 Google 步骤都停在它第一个真实的报错处
every Google step stops at its first honest error,

45
00:02:48,029 --> 00:02:49,938
我们会告诉你，你那边会输出什么
and we say what yours prints.

46
00:02:50,184 --> 00:02:53,976
我们跟的是 main，也就是课程网站链接的分支
We follow main, the branch the course site links,

47
00:02:53,976 --> 00:02:56,221
用的是 2025 年 11 月的这个 commit
at this November 2025 commit.

48
00:02:56,541 --> 00:02:59,068
看一下 Git 的提交日志，就知道你手上是哪一个
Git log tells you which one you have.

49
00:02:59,118 --> 00:03:01,512
第 1 部分手动做课上的热身
Part 1 does the lecture's warm-up by hand.

50
00:03:01,832 --> 00:03:04,264
第 2 部分把奶酪应用写成代码来部署
Part 2 deploys the cheese app as code.

51
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:07,000
我们把集群打开看看
Let's open the cluster.

52
00:03:07,213 --> 00:03:09,368
课上分三步画它
The lecture draws it in three steps.

53
00:03:09,688 --> 00:03:13,823
第一步：一个控制平面，箭头指向几个工作节点
First: one control plane, with arrows to several worker nodes,

54
00:03:13,823 --> 00:03:16,024
每个节点都是一台普通的虚拟机
each an ordinary virtual machine.

55
00:03:16,267 --> 00:03:18,294
第二步，两个平面有了名字
Second, the two planes get names.

56
00:03:18,614 --> 00:03:20,406
控制平面是大脑
The control plane is the brain.

57
00:03:20,726 --> 00:03:24,544
在 GKE 上，它由 Google 运行，你永远看不到它的机器
On GKE, Google runs it, and you never see its machines.

58
00:03:24,864 --> 00:03:26,959
工作节点承载你的 container
The workers carry your containers:

59
00:03:26,959 --> 00:03:29,856
对奶酪应用来说，是一个有一到两个节点的节点池
for the cheese app, a pool of one or two nodes.

60
00:03:30,100 --> 00:03:31,565
第三步，各个组件
Third, the parts.

61
00:03:31,615 --> 00:03:36,841
API server 是唯一的入口；其他组件都只和它通信
The API server is the single entry point; every other part talks only to it.

62
00:03:37,161 --> 00:03:41,983
其中 etcd 是集群的记忆：存着集群的状态和配置
Etcd is the memory of the cluster: its state and configuration.

63
00:03:42,217 --> 00:03:44,734
调度器给每个新 Pod 挑一个节点
The scheduler picks a node for each new Pod.

64
00:03:45,054 --> 00:03:46,803
控制器一直在盯着
The controllers keep watching

65
00:03:46,803 --> 00:03:50,662
把你要求的和实际运行的之间的任何差异修正过来
and fix any difference between what you asked for and what runs;

66
00:03:50,662 --> 00:03:53,737
其中一些会向云平台要节点和地址
some of them ask the cloud for nodes and addresses.

67
00:03:53,983 --> 00:03:58,079
每个工作节点上，kubelet 是 API server 的双手
On every worker, the kubelet is the hands of the API server:

68
00:03:58,079 --> 00:04:00,468
它负责启动和停止 container
it starts and stops the containers.

69
00:04:00,788 --> 00:04:03,477
节点上还有 kube-proxy，为 Service 转发流量
kube-proxy routes traffic for Services,

70
00:04:03,477 --> 00:04:06,082
container 运行时负责运行 container
and a container runtime runs the containers,

71
00:04:06,082 --> 00:04:07,682
这些 container 按 Pod 分组
grouped in Pods.

72
00:04:07,850 --> 00:04:11,327
说明一点：课件上写的运行时是 Docker
A small note: the slide names Docker as the runtime.

73
00:04:11,647 --> 00:04:14,023
在 GKE 上是 containerd
On GKE it is containerd,

74
00:04:14,023 --> 00:04:16,895
见 create cluster 那个文件的第 52 行
line 52 of create_cluster.py.

75
00:04:17,215 --> 00:04:20,821
你照样用 Docker 构建 image，它们原样运行
You still build images with Docker, and they run unchanged.

76
00:04:21,067 --> 00:04:22,667
现在顺着箭头走
Now follow the arrows.

77
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:25,793
每条 kubectl 命令都只去一个地方
Every kubectl command goes to one place,

78
00:04:25,793 --> 00:04:29,216
就是 API server，它把你的愿望存进 etcd
the API server, which stores your wish in etcd.

79
00:04:29,536 --> 00:04:32,480
调度器和 kubelet 都从它那里领活
The scheduler and the kubelets pick up their work from it.

80
00:04:32,717 --> 00:04:35,540
课上给 kubectl 定了一套语法
The lecture gives kubectl one grammar:

81
00:04:35,540 --> 00:04:39,032
命令、类型、可选的名字，再加参数
a command, a type, an optional name, and flags.

82
00:04:39,352 --> 00:04:40,646
命令 get nodes
Get nodes.

83
00:04:40,696 --> 00:04:44,727
命令 get pods。还有 get pods，加一个参数看所有 namespace
Get pods. Get pods, with a flag for every namespace.

84
00:04:44,967 --> 00:04:48,423
遇到卡住的时候，就问问是哪个组件在等
When something is stuck, ask which of these parts is waiting.

85
00:04:48,743 --> 00:04:51,454
这张图上有四个指示灯，之后会一个个亮起来
Four lamps on this picture will light up later,

86
00:04:51,454 --> 00:04:53,415
每个都对应一个你会碰到的症状
each with a symptom you will meet.

87
00:04:54,550 --> 00:04:58,198
README 把这段热身放在奶酪应用的部署之后
The README keeps this warm-up after the cheese app's deployment.

88
00:04:58,518 --> 00:05:04,491
课上先做它，我们也一样：这是和 kubectl 最温和的第一次接触
The lecture does it first, and so do we: it is the gentlest first contact with kubectl.

89
00:05:04,733 --> 00:05:07,741
首先，在控制台里启用五个 API
First, enable five APIs in the console.

90
00:05:08,061 --> 00:05:11,901
有一个小疏漏：Google Container Registry 已经关停了
A small slip: Google Container Registry has been shut down.

91
00:05:12,221 --> 00:05:14,589
改为启用 Artifact Registry
Enable Artifact Registry instead.

92
00:05:14,833 --> 00:05:19,676
然后启动工具箱：在 src 目录里，进到 deployment
Then start the toolbox: from the src folder, change into deployment and run docker-shell.sh.

93
00:05:19,676 --> 00:05:21,980
运行 docker-shell.sh
Then start the toolbox: from the src folder, change into deployment and run docker-shell.sh.

94
00:05:22,300 --> 00:05:24,024
按提交的原样，它会失败
As committed, it fails:

95
00:05:24,024 --> 00:05:27,847
先是 Debian 的 404 Not Found，然后是 pull access denied
404 Not Found from Debian, then pull access denied.

96
00:05:28,083 --> 00:05:30,869
如果你做过第 20 讲，就见过这个
If you did lecture 20, you have seen this:

97
00:05:30,869 --> 00:05:35,379
基础 image 是 Debian bullseye，它的安全更新包已经没了
the base image is Debian bullseye, whose security packages are gone.

98
00:05:35,699 --> 00:05:38,686
Windows 上没有 docker-shell.bat
On Windows there is no docker-shell.bat.

99
00:05:39,006 --> 00:05:40,583
用 WSL
Use WSL.

100
00:05:40,633 --> 00:05:44,238
修复还是那两处一行的修改，在这里是额外步骤
The fix is the same two one-line edits, an extra here.

101
00:05:44,558 --> 00:05:46,588
把 bullseye 换成 bookworm
Bullseye becomes bookworm,

102
00:05:46,588 --> 00:05:50,180
把 google-cloud-sdk 换成 google-cloud-cli
and google-cloud-sdk becomes google-cloud-cli,

103
00:05:50,180 --> 00:05:52,132
再加上它的 GKE 认证插件
with its GKE auth plugin.

104
00:05:52,452 --> 00:05:56,143
每次 kubectl 调用 GKE 都要经过这个插件
Every kubectl call to GKE goes through that plugin.

105
00:05:56,383 --> 00:05:57,849
和第 20 讲一样
As in lecture 20,

106
00:05:57,849 --> 00:06:02,335
也把你的项目填到 docker-shell.sh 的第 13 行
also put your project on line 13 of docker-shell.sh.

107
00:06:02,583 --> 00:06:06,423
再跑一次：大约 92 秒构建完，然后启动
Run it again: it builds in about 92 seconds and starts.

108
00:06:06,743 --> 00:06:10,823
接着登录失败，因为我们的密钥不属于任何账号
The login then fails, because our key belongs to no account;

109
00:06:10,823 --> 00:06:14,359
换成你的，这几行会显示 activated 和 logged in
with yours, these lines say activated and logged in.

110
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:16,679
在这里暂停一下，启动你的工具箱
Pause here and start your toolbox;

111
00:06:16,679 --> 00:06:19,187
这一部分剩下的步骤都在它的提示符下运行
the rest of this part runs at its prompt.

112
00:06:19,433 --> 00:06:21,033
接下来，检查工具
Next, check the tools.

113
00:06:21,246 --> 00:06:24,148
工具 gcloud 和它的认证插件都在
The gcloud tool and its auth plugin are there.

114
00:06:24,468 --> 00:06:27,143
只敲 kubectl version，会先打印客户端版本
Plain kubectl version prints the client,

115
00:06:27,143 --> 00:06:29,150
然后是 connection refused
then connection refused: there

116
00:06:29,150 --> 00:06:32,895
还没有集群，所以服务端那一半没有人可问
is no cluster yet, so the server half has nobody to ask.

117
00:06:33,883 --> 00:06:38,059
有个小意外：Dockerfile pin 了一个 kubectl 版本
A small surprise: the Dockerfile pins one kubectl version,

118
00:06:38,059 --> 00:06:43,099
但 Google 自己的包胜出了：一个按集群匹配版本的 dispatcher
but Google's own package wins: a dispatcher that matches each cluster.

119
00:06:43,333 --> 00:06:47,152
最后，检查你是否已经认证：gcloud auth list
Last, check that you are authenticated: gcloud auth list.

120
00:06:47,472 --> 00:06:49,737
我们的显示 No credentialed accounts
Ours says No credentialed accounts;

121
00:06:49,737 --> 00:06:53,168
你的会把 deployment 服务账号列为 active
yours lists the deployment service account as active.

122
00:06:54,417 --> 00:06:58,351
现在做 Create Cluster 这一步：gcloud container clusters
Now Create Cluster: gcloud container clusters create

123
00:06:58,351 --> 00:07:01,756
create test-cluster --num-nodes 2 --zone us-east1-c
test-cluster --num-nodes 2 --zone us-east1-c.

124
00:07:02,076 --> 00:07:04,892
我们的马上就停了：no active account
Ours stops at once: no active account.

125
00:07:05,212 --> 00:07:09,073
暂停一下，跑你的；它存在的每个小时都在花钱
Pause and run yours; it costs money every hour it exists.

126
00:07:09,717 --> 00:07:11,453
你的要等一会儿
Yours takes a short wait,

127
00:07:11,453 --> 00:07:15,063
打印一张表，并在你的 kubeconfig 里加一条记录
prints a table, and adds an entry to your kubeconfig

128
00:07:15,063 --> 00:07:17,077
让 kubectl 知道该连哪里
so kubectl knows where to go.

129
00:07:17,397 --> 00:07:19,015
课件上只建一个节点
The slide makes one node;

130
00:07:19,015 --> 00:07:22,965
README 建两个，这样两个副本可以落在不同的机器上
the README two, so two copies can land on different machines.

131
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:26,106
为了继续往下做，我们起一个小小的真集群
To keep going, we start a small real cluster

132
00:07:26,106 --> 00:07:30,731
在笔记本上用一个叫 kind 的工具：一个控制平面，两个工作节点
on the laptop with a tool called kind: one control plane, two workers.

133
00:07:31,051 --> 00:07:33,822
一样的 API server，一样的 kubectl
Same API server, same kubectl, same YAML,

134
00:07:33,822 --> 00:07:35,445
一样的 YAML，只是没有 Google
but no Google.

135
00:07:35,765 --> 00:07:38,176
它不在 README 里；你别跑
It is not in the README; don't run it.

136
00:07:38,750 --> 00:07:42,606
在这里，连控制平面都是一个我们看得见的 container
Here even the control plane is a container we can see;

137
00:07:42,606 --> 00:07:44,340
在 GKE 上，Google 把它藏起来了
on GKE, Google hides it.

138
00:07:44,584 --> 00:07:46,646
接下来，在控制台里看一圈
Next, look around the console:

139
00:07:46,646 --> 00:07:49,601
Kubernetes Engine、你的集群、它的节点
Kubernetes Engine, your cluster, its nodes,

140
00:07:49,601 --> 00:07:51,389
还有每个节点上的 Pod
and the Pods on each node.

141
00:07:51,709 --> 00:07:55,613
在 Compute Engine 里，你的节点就是普通的虚拟机
In Compute Engine, your nodes are ordinary virtual machines.

142
00:07:56,350 --> 00:07:58,505
然后试几条 kubectl 命令
Then try some kubectl commands.

143
00:07:58,825 --> 00:08:00,999
先来一个额外的，kubectl version
First an extra, kubectl version:

144
00:08:00,999 --> 00:08:05,417
dispatcher 挑了一个和服务端版本匹配的客户端
the dispatcher picked a client that matches the server's version.

145
00:08:05,967 --> 00:08:07,788
README 的第一条命令 get all
The first README command,

146
00:08:07,788 --> 00:08:11,212
只显示一个叫 kubernetes 的 Service
get all, shows only a service named kubernetes,

147
00:08:11,212 --> 00:08:13,690
它就是通往 API server 本身的门
the door to the API server itself.

148
00:08:14,010 --> 00:08:17,636
我们看的是叫 default 的 namespace；这个后面再说
We are looking in the namespace called default; more on that later.

149
00:08:18,184 --> 00:08:21,113
加上所有 namespace，kube-system 就出现了
With all namespaces, kube-system appears,

150
00:08:21,113 --> 00:08:24,542
在这里能按名字认出控制平面
and here you can spot the control plane by name:

151
00:08:24,542 --> 00:08:28,829
etcd、API server、controller manager 和调度器
etcd, the API server, the controller manager, the scheduler.

152
00:08:29,149 --> 00:08:31,026
在 GKE 上这些都是隐藏的
On GKE those stay hidden.

153
00:08:31,267 --> 00:08:34,385
命令 get componentstatuses 会打印一条弃用警告
componentstatuses prints a deprecation warning,

154
00:08:34,385 --> 00:08:37,304
这是预期的，然后是三行 healthy
which is expected, then three healthy lines.

155
00:08:37,624 --> 00:08:41,103
用 get nodes 检查更好：这里三个节点都是 Ready
Get nodes is the better check: three nodes ready here;

156
00:08:41,103 --> 00:08:44,003
你的会显示两个工作节点，没有控制平面
yours shows two workers and no control plane.

157
00:08:44,323 --> 00:08:45,966
暂停一下，五条都试一试
Pause and try all five.

158
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:50,259
热身部署一个小游戏，tic-tac-toe
The warm-up deploys a small game, tic-tac-toe,

159
00:08:50,259 --> 00:08:52,320
用的是一个文件里的两个对象
from one file with two objects.

160
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:55,013
Deployment 说明 Pod 里跑什么
The Deployment says what runs in a Pod,

161
00:08:55,013 --> 00:08:57,568
跑几个副本，并保持它们一直运行
how many copies, and to keep them running.

162
00:08:57,888 --> 00:09:01,536
Service 说明流量怎么到达它们，Pod 死了也没关系
The Service says how traffic reaches them, and lets Pods die.

163
00:09:01,783 --> 00:09:04,556
课件省略了把它们粘在一起的那几行
The slide trims the lines that glue them together.

164
00:09:04,876 --> 00:09:08,089
模板给每个 Pod 打上一个 label，run: web
The template gives every Pod a label, run: web;

165
00:09:08,089 --> 00:09:11,917
两个对象都按这个 label 找到自己的 Pod，而不是按名字
both objects find their Pods by that label, not by name.

166
00:09:12,467 --> 00:09:15,803
每个 Pod 运行 dlops/tic-tac-toe 这个 image
Each Pod runs the image dlops/tic-tac-toe,

167
00:09:15,803 --> 00:09:17,630
监听 port 8080
listening on port 8080.

168
00:09:17,950 --> 00:09:21,789
Service 监听 port 80，转发到 8080
The Service listens on port 80 and forwards to 8080.

169
00:09:23,033 --> 00:09:26,852
部署应用：kubectl apply -f，加上这个文件
Deploy the app: kubectl apply -f, and the file.

170
00:09:27,172 --> 00:09:29,828
命令 apply 只是把一个愿望交给 API server
Apply only hands a wish to the API server;

171
00:09:29,828 --> 00:09:34,319
调度器挑两个节点，它们的 kubelet 启动 container
the scheduler picks two nodes, and their kubelets start the containers.

172
00:09:34,867 --> 00:09:38,179
一个额外检查，rollout status，看着它发生
An extra check, rollout status, watches it happen:

173
00:09:38,179 --> 00:09:40,298
先是 0，然后 2 个里 1 个可用
zero, then one of two available,

174
00:09:40,298 --> 00:09:43,080
最后 rolled out，分别在两个不同的工作节点上
then rolled out, on two different workers.

175
00:09:44,817 --> 00:09:47,164
接下来，kubectl get services
Next, kubectl get services.

176
00:09:47,484 --> 00:09:50,951
名叫 web 的 Service 是一个负载均衡器
The web Service is a load balancer:

177
00:09:50,951 --> 00:09:57,489
port 80，映射到每个节点上的 31366，再到 Pod 里的 8080
port 80, mapped to 31366 on every node, and on to 8080 in the Pod.

178
00:09:57,809 --> 00:09:59,921
它的外部 IP 显示 pending
Its external IP says pending.

179
00:10:00,467 --> 00:10:03,027
43 秒以后还是 pending
43 seconds later it still says pending.

180
00:10:03,347 --> 00:10:06,504
集群图上是哪个组件在等，在等什么？
Which part of the cluster picture is waiting, and on what?

181
00:10:15,350 --> 00:10:18,209
是控制器，在等云平台
The controllers, waiting on the cloud provider.

182
00:10:18,529 --> 00:10:23,477
在 GKE 上，它们向 Google 要一个负载均衡器和一个地址
On GKE they ask Google for a load balancer and an address, which arrives

183
00:10:23,477 --> 00:10:25,071
等一会儿就来了
after a short wait.

184
00:10:25,121 --> 00:10:27,681
这个 kind 集群没有云平台可问
The kind cluster has no cloud to ask.

185
00:10:28,417 --> 00:10:31,307
暂停一下：在 GKE 上，等外部 IP 出来
Pause: on GKE, wait for the external IP,

186
00:10:31,307 --> 00:10:34,774
把它复制到浏览器里，游戏就出现了
copy it into your browser, and the game appears.

187
00:10:36,017 --> 00:10:37,916
在替身上，一个额外步骤
On the stand-in, an extra:

188
00:10:37,916 --> 00:10:41,350
对这个 Service 做 port-forward，再 curl：200 OK
port-forward to the Service, then curl: 200 OK.

189
00:10:41,670 --> 00:10:44,239
课上建议在你的浏览器里打开
The lecture suggests it for your browser,

190
00:10:44,239 --> 00:10:47,689
但在工具箱里，这个 port 是在 container 里面打开的
but from the toolbox the port opens inside the container:

191
00:10:47,689 --> 00:10:49,289
就在那里测
test it there.

192
00:10:49,933 --> 00:10:53,453
回到半夜那个问题：谁来重启 container？
Back to the night-time problem: who restarts the container?

193
00:10:53,773 --> 00:10:56,034
在 Kubernetes 里，是控制器
In Kubernetes, a controller does.

194
00:10:56,354 --> 00:10:57,954
我们来看一个控制器干活
Let's watch one work.

195
00:10:58,233 --> 00:11:00,281
一个额外的列表把这条链显示出来
An extra listing shows the chain.

196
00:11:00,601 --> 00:11:03,407
名叫 web 的 Deployment 拥有一个 ReplicaSet
The Deployment named web owns a ReplicaSet,

197
00:11:03,407 --> 00:11:06,212
它的名字加上了 Pod 模板的哈希值
whose name adds a hash of the Pod template.

198
00:11:06,532 --> 00:11:08,479
这个 ReplicaSet 拥有两个 Pod
The ReplicaSet owns two Pods,

199
00:11:08,479 --> 00:11:11,566
每个都带着这个哈希值和一个随机的短后缀
each with that hash and a short random suffix.

200
00:11:12,100 --> 00:11:13,499
看 label 就能确认
The labels confirm it:

201
00:11:13,499 --> 00:11:17,220
每个 Pod 都带着模板哈希和 run: web 这个 label
every Pod carries the template hash and the run: web label.

202
00:11:17,466 --> 00:11:19,821
ReplicaSet 控制器跑一个循环
The ReplicaSet controller runs a loop:

203
00:11:19,821 --> 00:11:24,655
观察 Pod，和你声明的数量比较，针对差异采取行动
observe the Pods, compare with the number you declared, act on the difference.

204
00:11:24,975 --> 00:11:28,922
数量由你设；控制器让它一直成立，就像恒温器
You set the number; the controller keeps it true, like a thermostat.

205
00:11:29,466 --> 00:11:33,413
先再来一个额外的：kubectl scale，replicas 设成 4
First, one more extra: kubectl scale --replicas=4.

206
00:11:33,733 --> 00:11:36,558
又出现两个 Pod，分布在两个工作节点上
Two more Pods appear, spread over both workers,

207
00:11:36,558 --> 00:11:38,661
Service 已经把它们列进去了
and the Service already lists them.

208
00:11:38,981 --> 00:11:44,485
缩回 2 个，记住这条命令：你们项目的 Milestone 5 会要求它
Scale back to 2, and remember this command: your project's Milestone 5 asks for it.

209
00:11:45,050 --> 00:11:47,247
现在删掉两个 web Pod 中的一个
Now delete one of the two web Pods.

210
00:11:47,567 --> 00:11:52,623
一秒钟后，有几个 web Pod，新名字里哪一部分保持不变？
A second later, how many web Pods are there, and which part of the new name stays the same?

211
00:12:01,466 --> 00:12:06,245
两个。命令 delete 一返回，新 Pod 就已经在创建了
Two. The delete returns, and a new Pod is already being created.

212
00:12:06,565 --> 00:12:10,042
它的名字保留了 ReplicaSet 的哈希值，后缀是新的
Its name keeps the ReplicaSet hash, with a new suffix.

213
00:12:10,283 --> 00:12:12,480
15 秒后，两个都在运行
15 seconds later, both run.

214
00:12:12,800 --> 00:12:15,872
没有人登录：循环发现了差异，就动手了
Nobody logged in: the loop noticed, and acted.

215
00:12:16,116 --> 00:12:21,364
这就勾上了故障转移，再加一个如实的补充：这是重启，不是热备
That ticks failover, with an honest footnote: it is a restart, not a hot standby.

216
00:12:21,684 --> 00:12:27,487
只有一个副本时会有一段短暂的空档，所以游戏的文件要求两个副本
With one replica there is a short gap, which is why the game's file asks for two replicas.

217
00:12:28,033 --> 00:12:32,193
在第 20 讲里，Docker 在同一台机器上重启 container
In lecture 20, Docker restarted a container on the same machine.

218
00:12:32,513 --> 00:12:35,990
ReplicaSet 会把新 Pod 放到任何有空间的地方
A ReplicaSet places a new Pod wherever there is room.

219
00:12:36,310 --> 00:12:38,700
声明结果，别去写步骤的脚本
Declare the result, don't script the steps.

220
00:12:39,950 --> 00:12:42,745
Pod 是会死的：新 Pod 拿到了一个新地址
Pods are mortal: the new Pod got a new address.

221
00:12:43,065 --> 00:12:44,814
那流量怎么找到它？
So how does traffic find it?

222
00:12:45,134 --> 00:12:46,729
Service 维护一张列表
The Service keeps a list of every Pod wearing its label, and that list follows the Pods.

223
00:12:46,729 --> 00:12:50,339
记着每个贴着它 label 的 Pod，这张列表跟着 Pod 变
The Service keeps a list of every Pod wearing its label, and that list follows the Pods.

224
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:55,065
从一个用完即弃的 Pod 里做个额外检查
An extra from a throwaway Pod:

225
00:12:55,065 --> 00:13:00,078
web.default.svc.cluster.local 这个名字指向这个 Service
the name web.default.svc.cluster.local points to the Service,

226
00:13:00,078 --> 00:13:03,693
只取 web 就能拿到游戏页面
and fetching just web returns the game page.

227
00:13:04,013 --> 00:13:06,040
Pod 在变，名字不变
The name stays while the Pods change.

228
00:13:06,283 --> 00:13:10,320
奶酪应用的 API 之后也会这样找到它的数据库
This is how the cheese app's API will find its database:

229
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:12,555
按 Service 名字，vector-db
by the Service name, vector-db.

230
00:13:12,800 --> 00:13:16,704
再一个额外的：kubectl exec 进到 web 这个 Deployment
Another extra: kubectl exec into the web Deployment.

231
00:13:17,024 --> 00:13:19,940
命令 hostname 打印出其中一个 Pod 的名字
Hostname prints the name of one Pod, and the game's files are inside.

232
00:13:19,940 --> 00:13:21,540
游戏的文件就在里面
Hostname prints the name of one Pod, and the game's files are inside.

233
00:13:21,632 --> 00:13:24,619
README 也是这样进到 API 的 shell 里
The README shells into the API the same way.

234
00:13:24,867 --> 00:13:26,659
为什么 get all 看起来是空的？
Why did get all look empty?

235
00:13:26,979 --> 00:13:29,560
因为 namespace：装对象的目录
Namespaces: folders for objects.

236
00:13:29,880 --> 00:13:33,090
不加参数时，kubectl 只看 default
Without a flag, kubectl looks only in default;

237
00:13:33,090 --> 00:13:34,626
这个额外步骤先把它们列出来
this extra lists them,

238
00:13:34,626 --> 00:13:38,115
再创建并删除 cheese-app-namespace
then creates and deletes the cheese-app-namespace.

239
00:13:38,733 --> 00:13:41,711
所以在第 2 部分，每条和应用有关的命令都要
So in part 2, every command about the app

240
00:13:41,711 --> 00:13:45,197
在参数的位置加上 -n cheese-app-namespace
gets -n cheese-app-namespace, in the flags slot.

241
00:13:45,833 --> 00:13:51,124
删除集群之前，一个额外提示：用同一个文件做 kubectl delete
Before deleting the cluster, an extra tip: kubectl delete with the same file.

242
00:13:51,444 --> 00:13:56,372
在 GKE 上，这样能在集群还在的时候把负载均衡器释放掉
On GKE, this releases the load balancer while the cluster still exists.

243
00:13:56,617 --> 00:13:58,923
然后删除集群：gcloud container clusters
Then delete the cluster:

244
00:13:58,923 --> 00:14:03,465
delete test-cluster --zone us-east1-c
gcloud container clusters delete test-cluster --zone us-east1-c.

245
00:14:03,785 --> 00:14:06,601
你的会问要不要继续；回答 yes
Yours asks whether to continue; answer yes.

246
00:14:07,150 --> 00:14:08,750
替身我们也删掉
We delete the stand-in too.

247
00:14:10,650 --> 00:14:14,170
课上最后一句话用在这里正合适：别忘了删除
The lecture's last word fits here: don't forget to delete.

248
00:14:14,490 --> 00:14:18,351
暂停一下，确认你的测试集群已经没了，第 1 部分就完成了
Pause, check that your test cluster is gone, and part 1 is done.
